<h3>Quick Start</h3>

<ol>

<li>Inspect the receiver and transmitter.</li>

<li>Verify batteries are charged.</li>

<li>Connect the transmitter to the target utility.</li>

<li>Place the ground stake into moist soil.</li>

<li>Attach the black lead to the ground stake.</li>

<li>Attach the red lead to the utility.</li>

<li>Select the desired frequency.</li>

<li>Turn on the receiver.</li>

<li>Adjust gain until the signal is stable.</li>

<li>Walk slowly following the peak signal.</li>

<li>Confirm direction changes.</li>

<li>Measure depth where required.</li>

</ol>

